commit e9cc9bc3b893583a1d4fdf146bdbdcbe3e8d2460

C03: the visible-click script compiles under Windows PowerShell 5.1 (UI1273 repair)

Its embedded C# used inline out declarations (C# 7) that the Add-Type
compiler of Windows PowerShell 5.1 rejects, so every input.visible.click
ended in visible_click_no_receipt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


